{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit the balls and create combos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number Crush is an exhilarating puzzle action game where you hit and knock balls with the same number together like billiards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hit balls with the same number to make them combine into a bigger number!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Add the number of balls that combine to your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Combine many balls in one hit for a combo! Your score will go up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get more balls if they land in your pocket! A chance to improve your score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple controls, just select a ball and hit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim for a high score within the stroke limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How big can you make the balls that accelerate and decelerate repeatedly?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u3088\u3046\u3053\u305d\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839740/4e69660be4f4c3d58399199c420b6e59527161ce.jpg"},{"name":"\u8131\u30fb\u521d\u5fc3\u8005","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839740/42c744aa9acb3b3e6b8ffe135b0cafb40cf36c9c.jpg"},{"name":"\u6841\u9055\u3044","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839740/3a67ee6694b4fb6f3302ad869c00c5e8aad5a4a0.jpg"},{"name":"Super Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839740/ed8f4f4b58050325018a0a05b32f1c16c4d709db.jpg"},{"name":"\u30dd\u30b1\u30c3\u30c8\u5236\u8987","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3839740/4b944c691ff96235ae66d16bef7c3077af4b2462.jpg"},{"name":"\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u306a\u624d\u80fd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun